fx!","a":"—","d":"","n":"#192","p":8,"im":[],"m":192},{"id":"finddecision_p8_193","t":"I found the major moves on D1, then dropped to LTF to find what happened and why.\n\nOld zones that come into play later:","a":"—","d":"","n":"#193","p":8,"im":["fc757882dab1454b956ec395f18472f213880bc2","07fb9bd3ec9382c47bf17905fa1588bee8e67cbe","f0118f5708bcb3f72fc3f41ff77bdb26dc61392a","81819e70558460c797796a109a6fc5bf6878dc87","ddd3dc38984725fd536d1b0e3cbf089d8ec80d82","da74e475848169944aeccc6e5203c4940bf1366c","24e4f6f4494e8adab3dc596f5235f71679ceb8f9","20fdd5bf3043d026bfe0e165ac355bedcfbd5b63","c8bdf5b1b8ac7ea29e524885cd079082398d27e5","4b870f2f3a5d142b09411312427449a383a58ac5","d5cc9dac0ffed66525d215f4337fba03de168823","f992dfb34fcec245a7fcf3403201ed7b6a498bcc","10845909d6392aa9316a4a649a0ae8d2acf0516d","6f6769df224740c2c4946f6df2cb0c4c8e21bcdf","cdfb4b579a4d6d1a77959d9745c6d25d7ce42ed2","d1ea9a55cbbefe7f8030e8111f317acc31f92ec6","d89f6e686e7d466226c5a3a506144a8ae6b21937","f68ab38fc8ce206bb420de942302973a35160619","e2c1f52b6d0a70e4f04f7c81c7469258edabc644","84a5bd177cd7019662251a4f2e4d892bf3950623"],"m":193},{"id":"finddecision_p8_194","t":"20 pics is apparently the limit. OK, round 2:","a":"—","d":"","n":"#194","p":8,"im":["6f743c2ac6fe492fae0be2c3a5f789af918d2336","968d1da34785e13805107b407893c92702358e68","54d22576bcddda815b74c96704ee4cfdd8052528","a9ffd6169557b9e4221b010ddb5075e0127ef8e2","e9a5c02cc32c33005753c35cbc863be30e2130dd","076d2055d03c351bfe6053397c697862546bad00","144f7e947181cea128cbad209a250f325bf3d4dc","28fe177a252cd2ac2dbd09c0224107fffe07c271","f4763084ac885283b3205c733c379646b7c8e835","d8d34479d7ccb08f2075d254dccad27f32eec19b","a6cc9ca2f447b347b7cf63abb9fdc66569caa1cf"],"m":194},{"id":"finddecision_p8_195","t":"Harry\n\nthat's the spirit of that exercise. open a chart and mark a turn. then look left for the reason. do that every day, helps a lot","a":"—","d":"","n":"#195","p":8,"im":[],"m":195},{"id":"finddecision_p8_196","t":"Please guide.","a":"—","d":"